  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a7f4a33f894b2b440a0c98d90dc2de4f, type: 3}
  m_Name: Pistol_EugeneStoner
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  specialistName: Eugene Stoner
  callFee: 40
  startNodeID: start
  nodes:
  - nodeID: start
    speaker: 0
    text: Got a pistol here, guy's asking $650. Says it's the real deal.
    inspectionHintID: 
    nextNodeID: greet
    choices: []
  - nodeID: greet
    speaker: 1
    text: Alright, walk me through what you're seeing on it.
    inspectionHintID: 
    nextNodeID: hub
    choices: []
  - nodeID: hub
    speaker: 0
    text: 
    inspectionHintID: 
    nextNodeID: 
    choices:
    - choiceText: It's got a logo on the handle.
      nextNodeID: logo_ask
    - choiceText: There's engraving on the slide.
      nextNodeID: engrave_ask
    - choiceText: Finish looks chrome or nickel.
      nextNodeID: chrome_info
    - choiceText: Grip panels are wood.
      nextNodeID: wood_info
    - choiceText: No, I think I've got what I need.
      nextNodeID: end
  - nodeID: logo_ask
    speaker: 1
    text: "What's the logo \u2014 a bullet shape?"
    inspectionHintID: 
    nextNodeID: logo_choice
    choices: []
  - nodeID: logo_choice
    speaker: 0
    text: 
    inspectionHintID: 
    nextNodeID: 
    choices:
    - choiceText: Yeah, looks like a bullet.
      nextNodeID: logo_bullet_info
    - choiceText: Something else, not sure.
      nextNodeID: logo_other_info
  - nodeID: logo_bullet_info
    speaker: 1
    text: Then the handle should be red, that's factory spec for that line. Serial
      number should fall between 345 and 760.
    inspectionHintID: pistol_bullet_logo
    nextNodeID: hub
    choices: []
  - nodeID: logo_other_info
    speaker: 1
    text: Hm, without knowing the exact logo I can't tell you much. Get a closer
      look and call back if you can make it out.
    inspectionHintID: 
    nextNodeID: hub
    choices: []
  - nodeID: engrave_ask
    speaker: 1
    text: Star-shaped?
    inspectionHintID: 
    nextNodeID: engrave_choice
    choices: []
  - nodeID: engrave_choice
    speaker: 0
    text: 
    inspectionHintID: 
    nextNodeID: 
    choices:
    - choiceText: Yeah, it's a star.
      nextNodeID: engrave_star_info
    - choiceText: No, different shape.
      nextNodeID: engrave_other_info
  - nodeID: engrave_star_info
    speaker: 1
    text: Then grip color should be black, no exceptions on that combo. Serial number
      should start with a 7.
    inspectionHintID: pistol_star_engraving
    nextNodeID: hub
    choices: []
  - nodeID: engrave_other_info
    speaker: 1
    text: Not something I can cross-reference off the top of my head. Star engraving's
      the one with known specs.
    inspectionHintID: 
    nextNodeID: hub
    choices: []
  - nodeID: chrome_info
    speaker: 1
    text: If it's genuinely chrome or nickel, manufacture year should be after 1990.
      And the serial shouldn't contain a zero anywhere.
    inspectionHintID: pistol_chrome_finish
    nextNodeID: hub
    choices: []
  - nodeID: wood_info
    speaker: 1
    text: Trigger guard should be rounded, not squared, to match that grip style.
      Serial number needs to be under 500.
    inspectionHintID: pistol_wood_grip
    nextNodeID: hub
    choices: []
  - nodeID: end
    speaker: 1
    text: Alright. Go through it careful before you hand over any cash. Good luck.
    inspectionHintID: 
    nextNodeID: 
    choices: []
